00:59:33.240 --> 00:59:36.440
which is itself like a
probabilistic approximate simulator,

00:59:36.440 --> 00:59:38.180
let's say a physics, okay.

00:59:38.180 --> 00:59:40.320
This is an interesting challenge, okay.

00:59:40.320 --> 00:59:42.420
It's not the sort of thing that you have

00:59:42.420 --> 00:59:44.810
