learn a neural network.

00:59:44.810 --> 00:59:47.000
We sometimes call this to contrast

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:48.440
with learning in a neural network

00:59:48.440 --> 00:59:50.650
where there's a smooth error surface,

00:59:50.650 --> 00:59:52.950
and you can use these
gradient descent algorithms,

00:59:52.950 --> 00:59:55.690
basically, just multi-variable calculus,

00:59:55.690 --> 00:59:58.380
to optimize all the parameters,
to train the system,

00:59:58.380 --> 01:00:00.590
to produce the right
input output behavior.

01:00:00.590 --> 01:00:02.850
If goal is to search through the space

01:00:02.850 --> 01:00:04.740
of all simulation programs,

01:00:04.740 --> 01:00:06.890
there's no nice topology or geometry,

01:00:06.890 --> 01:00:08.880
it's a much harder search problem.

01:00:08.880 --> 01:00:11.520
